    {
      "body": "Every node file carries identity, provenance and append-only estimate\nrecords. A reviewer reading a diff cannot confirm that an ID is well formed,\nthat a reference resolves, or that an estimate record was added rather than\nquietly rewritten. Without a machine check the discipline is a convention,\nand conventions decay under time pressure.\n",
